You are also given an array `cost`, where `cost[i]` represents the gas required to travel from station `i` to station `(i + 1)`.
You have an unlimited-capacity car and start with an empty tank.
Return the **index of the station from which you can start** and complete the entire circular route exactly once.
If it is impossible, return `-1`.

